<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">René Barrientos</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates"><a href="/years/1919">1919</a>–<a href="/years/1969">1969</a></span> · <a href="/centuries/20th-century">20th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">René Barrientos was a Bolivian air force general who, as vice-president, overthrew President <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/victor-paz-estenssoro">Víctor Paz Estenssoro</a> in November 1964. He ruled <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/bolivia">Bolivia</a>, as junta leader and then elected president, until his death in a <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/helicopter">helicopter</a> crash in 1969. His government repressed the mining unions, notably at Siglo XX in 1967, and its army captured and executed <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/che-guevara">Che Guevara</a> the same year.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/rene-barrientos.jpg" alt="René Barrientos" width="320" height="446" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Unknown author · Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Ren%C3%A9_Barrientos_1.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
<section class="enc-quotes"><h2 class="enc-section-title">Across the Institute</h2><ul><li><blockquote>Military governments dominated from 1964 to 1982, including those of <b>René Barrientos</b> and Hugo Banzer.</blockquote><a href="/empire/republic-of-bolivia">Republic of Bolivia · Governance &amp; Law</a></li></ul></section>
<section class="enc-where enc-born"><h2 class="enc-section-title">Born and died</h2><p class="enc-born-p">Born in Tarata, in what is now <a href="/countries/bolivia">Bolivia</a>. Died in Cochabamba, in what is now <a href="/countries/bolivia">Bolivia</a>. <span class="enc-born-src">Places as Wikidata records them.</span></p><figure class="st-locator enc-loc"><a href="/atlas?at=-17.61,-66.02&amp;year=1951" aria-label="Tarata on the atlas"><svg class="map map-loc" viewBox="2757 2817 900 540" role="img" aria-label="Map: the birthplace of René Barrientos"><image href="/maps/world.svg" x="0" y="0" width="10000" height="4393"/><path class="map-dot-halo" d="M3207 3087h0"/><path class="map-dot-me" d="M3207 3087h0"/></svg></a><figcaption>The dot marks the birthplace. <a href="/atlas?at=-17.61,-66.02&amp;year=1951">What was here in 1951? &rarr;</a></figcaption></figure></section>
